      <section id="problem" className="landing-section mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-24 md:px-10 md:py-32"><div className="max-w-2xl"><div className="eyebrow text-cyan-300">The gap</div><h2 className="mt-5 font-serif text-4xl leading-tight text-white md:text-6xl">Your life has context.<br /><span className="text-slate-500">Most AI forgets it.</span></h2><p className="mt-7 text-base leading-8 text-slate-400">Every new prompt starts from zero. The plans you make, the patterns you notice, the promises you keep — scattered across tabs and lost between conversations.</p></div><div className="mt-14 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><div className="glass-card p-6"><div className="font-mono text-2xl text-cyan-300">01</div><h3 className="mt-8 font-semibold text-white">Context gets lost</h3><p className="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-500">The good idea from last Tuesday should still be useful today.</p></div><div className="glass-card p-6"><div className="font-mono text-2xl text-violet-300">02</div><h3 className="mt-8 font-semibold text-white">Attention gets fragmented</h3><p className="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-500">Your goals, meetings, and thoughts rarely speak to each other.</p></div><div className="glass-card p-6"><div className="font-mono text-2xl text-blue-300">03</div><h3 className="mt-8 font-semibold text-white">Progress feels invisible</h3><p className="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-500">You are moving. You just need a clearer read on the arc.</p></div></div></section>
